contempt|REVIEW: Emotional disrespect and court-related contempt are separate noun boundaries. The legal example reports a finding without prescribing a penalty; jurisdiction and precise Vietnamese legal terminology remain unresolved for owner review.
eligible|PASS: Completed training supplies fictional eligibility conditions without claiming real voting law or guaranteed selection. For a role and to do a task are distinguished; đủ điều kiện is a standalone Vietnamese gloss.
inclusion|PASS: Social participation and adding an image to an issue preserve different source ordinals and complement patterns. Several languages is faithfully translated; source evidence does not approve a social-policy taxonomy.
regain|PASS: The team gets a lead back after losing it, rather than merely obtaining a new lead. Transitive syntax and source ordinal agree; no medical recovery claim is introduced by the example.
school|PASS: Institution and scheduled teaching time are maintained as separate proposals. Article guidance is qualified by often; the Vietnamese literacy-class and end-of-day examples keep the distinct boundaries.
